<http://purl.bioontology.org/ontology/STY/T047> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "A condition which alters or interferes with a normal process, state, or activity of an organism. It is usually characterized by the abnormal functioning of one or more of the host's systems, parts, or organs. Included here is a complex of symptoms descriptive of a disorder." .
